# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Punji the Labrador — YouTube Metadata MCP Server
# Environment Variables Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real values.
# .env is gitignored — never commit it.

# YouTube Data API v3 key (read-only access — for fetch_video_data)
# Get this from: Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → API Keys
# Enable "YouTube Data API v3" in your project first.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_data_api_v3_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: OAuth 2.0 credentials are NOT stored here.
# For write access (update_video_metadata), you need:
#   client_secrets.json — downloaded from Google Cloud Console
#                         (OAuth 2.0 Client ID, type: Desktop App)
#                         Place in the project root directory.
#   token.json          — auto-created on first run of authenticate_youtube tool.
#                         DO NOT commit this file to git.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
